    "Hungarian" : {},
    "I build this app alone, and right now the only usage I can see is my own. Your counts show me what actually breaks." : {},
    "If the browser didn't open, click \"Connect Trello\" again." : {},
    "If you enjoy WhisperShortcut, feel free to buy it on the App Store and leave a short review. It really helps me out as a solo developer.\n\nBest wishes from Heidelberg, Germany" : {},
    "If you have feedback, if something doesn't work, or if you have suggestions for improvement, message me on WhatsApp or send an email — whichever suits you." : {},
